  "_gazetteer": "Optional. A locality gazetteer in the areas.json format gives door-level-ish distance sorting; without one, venues in that city are placed at the city centroid and distance sorting is switched off for them rather than being faked. Run geocode_areas.py to build one.",
  "_districts_empty": "An empty districts list makes the scraper discover them from the site. Prefer an explicit list so a run is reproducible.",
