  "_aliases": "Other spellings of the city's own name. Anything matching one is refused as a locality: an address always ends with the city, and the resolver takes the last match, so a single 'bangalore' entry filed 1,298 Bengaluru venues under one useless area.",
  "_default": "The city the site opens on. Falls back to whichever has the most venues. Hyderabad is the deliberate default: it is the only city with scored inspections, so opening on it shows what the site is for. Opening on Delhi would present a directory of paid voluntary certificates as the headline product."
